kNvwE6hD9X&_nc_oc=Adr38RdoktcA6bpW4epd08mqovmFfcazBSD0fdyifvxKqo3awYwUa_cdXVG8J5tLhf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHrQSPD3BYO-MhYy0P7_MeJiWhUnAgX5Si3Miatzf_KPw&oe=6A859B2F"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "2024374425127983", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595117516_2024374428461316_3747183630669007981_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIjDc6K6sBoQ7kNvwH0nOeE&_nc_oc=Adp7gNHyibJ4j9z_JZzRl9cUQgC2vCQD3FD9zF-FS2SmSfdck5A5QaXY0nRDbQV4rj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFzYvZhpU5xm6bzYok4Q09RWMb1rhPpbKKxuU9Ed9-eUA&oe=6A857F8B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VIRNECT View 3", "keywords": ["virnect", "\ubc84\ub125\ud2b8", "view", "ar", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View 3.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduc